WEBVTT

00:00:29.742 --> 00:00:34.705
hrabro ići tamo gdje još nitko nije išao.

00:00:34.705 --> 00:00:36.190
Dakle —

00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:41.654
(Pljesak) —

00:00:42.906 --> 00:00:47.561
Ja sam unuk japanskih imigranata

00:00:47.561 --> 00:00:49.692
koji su otišli u Ameriku,

00:00:49.692 --> 00:00:53.177
u nepoznat svijet,

00:00:53.177 --> 00:00:56.013
u potrazi za novim prilikama.

00:00:56.013 --> 00:00:59.499
Moja majka je rođena 
u Sacramentu, u Kaliforniji.

00:00:59.499 --> 00:01:01.940
Moj otac je iz San Francisca.